deId":"kp:21423","proposedNodeId":null,"kind":"method_application","origin":"editorial_proposal","title":"旋转保距与两点距离比较证明两角差余弦","scope":"L247 教案原题与原解有源整理；转换渲染页不是印刷页。短quote才是原句。","blocks":[{"role":"condition","type":"text","value":"$\\alpha,\\beta$为任意角，顶点为原点$O$，始边为$x$轴正半轴，终边交单位圆于$A(\\cos\\alpha,\\sin\\alpha),B(\\cos\\beta,\\sin\\beta)$。","sourceString":"$\\alpha,\\beta$为任意角，顶点为原点$O$，始边为$x$轴正半轴，终边交单位圆于$A(\\cos\\alpha,\\sin\\alpha),B(\\cos\\beta,\\sin\\beta)$。","sourceStringKind":"source_supported_editorial_summary_not_verbatim","evidenceIds":["ev:book-2:L247:rotation-distance-cosine-proof-b0"]},{"role":"step","type":"text","value":"同时绕$O$旋转$-\\beta$，得到$A^{\\prime}(\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta),\\sin(\\alpha-\\beta)),B^{\\prime}(1,0)$。旋转保距，$|AB|=|A^{\\prime}B^{\\prime}|$。","sourceString":"同时绕$O$旋转$-\\beta$，得到$A^{\\prime}(\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta),\\sin(\\alpha-\\beta)),B^{\\prime}(1,0)$。旋转保距，$|AB|=|A^{\\prime}B^{\\prime}|$。","sourceStringKind":"source_supported_editorial_summary_not_verbatim","evidenceIds":["ev:book-2:L247:rotation-distance-cosine-proof-b1"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"$|AB|^2=(\\cos\\alpha-\\cos\\beta)^2+(\\sin\\alpha-\\sin\\beta)^2=\\cos^2\\alpha-2\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\cos^2\\beta+\\sin^2\\alpha-2\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta+\\sin^2\\beta=2-2(\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta)$。","sourceString":"$|AB|^2=(\\cos\\alpha-\\cos\\beta)^2+(\\sin\\alpha-\\sin\\beta)^2=\\cos^2\\alpha-2\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\cos^2\\beta+\\sin^2\\alpha-2\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta+\\sin^2\\beta=2-2(\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta)$。","sourceStringKind":"source_supported_editorial_summary_not_verbatim","evidenceIds":["ev:book-2:L247:rotation-distance-cosine-proof-b2"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"$|A^{\\prime}B^{\\prime}|^2=[\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)-1]^2+\\sin^2(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\cos^2(\\alpha-\\beta)-2\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)+1+\\sin^2(\\alpha-\\beta)=2-2\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)$。","sourceString":"$|A^{\\prime}B^{\\prime}|^2=[\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)-1]^2+\\sin^2(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\cos^2(\\alpha-\\beta)-2\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)+1+\\sin^2(\\alpha-\\beta)=2-2\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)$。","sourceStringKind":"source_supported_editorial_summary_not_verbatim","evidenceIds":["ev:book-2:L247:rotation-distance-cosine-proof-b3"]},{"role":"solution","type":"text","value":"两式相等，得$2-2(\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta)=2-2\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)$，从而$\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta$。任意给定两角均成立。","sourceString":"两式相等，得$2-2(\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta)=2-2\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)$，从而$\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta+\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta$。任意给定两角均成立。","sourceStringKind":"source_supported_editorial_summary_not_verbatim","evidenceIds":["ev:book-2:L247:rotation-distance-cosine-proof-b4"]},{"role":"context","type":"text","value":"[设计意图] 在平面直角坐标系中采用解析法，通过构造图形证明了两角差的余弦公式，并在两角差的余弦公式的基础上，利用角的代换，结合诱导公式推导了两角和的余弦公式，提高分析与论证能力，提升直观想象与逻辑推理素养．","sourceString":"[设计意图] 在平面直角坐标系中采用解析法，通过构造图形证明了两角差的余弦公式，并在两角差的余弦公式的基础上，利用角的代换，结合诱导公式推导了两角和的余弦公式，提高分析与论证能力，提升直观想象与逻辑推理素养．","sourceStringKind":"source_supported_editorial_summary_not_verbatim","evidenceIds":["ev:book-2:L247:rotation-distance-cosine-proof-b5"]}],"contentOrigin":"source_supported_editorial_summary","wordingStatus":"教案有源整理、非逐字","matching":{"status":"confirmed","reason":"依据实际向量操作、条件与解题过程。"},"evidence":[{"id":"ev:book-2:L247:rotation-distance-cosine-proof-b0","sourceId":"L247","sourceSha256":"155ceaa25915fc2c39b7862e741ff617dc5f73c15b5e3c1d2bd00c4c38ef5f99","locator":{"headingPath":["L247","旋转保距与两点距离比较证明两角差余弦"],"part":"converted-docx/word/document.xml","conversionArtifact":"increments/l247-v1/work/L247-conversion/L247.docx","paragraphIndex":23,"paragraphIndexConvention":"1-based all .//w:p in conversion artifact; not original DOC XML","tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":3,"pdfPage":3,"printedPage":null,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"重合，它们的终边分别与单位圆相交于","transcriptionWordingStatus":"教案有源